#: ../../packages/legal/src/PrivacyBooking.tsx#PrivacyBooking
msgid ""
"Processing is based on Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR for the initiation of a consulting "
"engagement (pre-contractual measures). Booking data is automatically deleted "
"90 days after the appointment date. If a contractual relationship arises from "
"the booking and tax or commercial law retention obligations apply (§ 257 HGB,"
" § 147 AO), the relevant data will be retained for up to 10 years. Terminaro "
"does not set any cookies on the public website and does not use tracking or "
"web analytics."
msgstr ""
"Processing is based on Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR for the initiation of a consulting "
"engagement (pre-contractual measures). Booking data is automatically deleted "
"90 days after the appointment date. If a contractual relationship arises from "
"the booking and tax or commercial law retention obligations apply (§ 257 HGB,"
" § 147 AO), the relevant data will be retained for up to 10 years. Terminaro "
"does not set any cookies on the public website and does not use tracking or "
"web analytics."

#: ../../packages/legal/src/PrivacyHosting.tsx#PrivacyHosting
msgid ""
"Processing is based on Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR. Our legitimate interest lies in "
"ensuring the availability, integrity and security of the website. This "
"interest outweighs the data subjects' interest in non-processing, as, "
"according to a contractual assurance by Bunny.net, connection data is "
"processed exclusively transiently in working memory and automatically deleted "
"after a few seconds. Insofar as information on the user's terminal device is "
"accessed (e.g. through edge scripting), this is permissible without consent "
"pursuant to Section 25(2)(2) TDDDG, as the access is strictly necessary to "
"provide the service explicitly requested by the user."
msgstr ""
"Processing is based on Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR. Our legitimate interest lies in "
"ensuring the availability, integrity and security of the website. This "
"interest outweighs the data subjects' interest in non-processing, as, "
"according to a contractual assurance by Bunny.net, connection data is "
"processed exclusively transiently in working memory and automatically deleted "
"after a few seconds. Insofar as information on the user's terminal device is "
"accessed (e.g. through edge scripting), this is permissible without consent "
"pursuant to Section 25(2)(2) TDDDG, as the access is strictly necessary to "
"provide the service explicitly requested by the user."

